{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fogpiercer is a deckbuilder roguelite in which you build and upgrade your train to build your deck, fight off bandits on a square grid using unique carriage cards. Your final deck will depend on the decisions you make in the run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Moments Of Genius</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Positioning is key and if you play your cards right, you can get the enemies to attack each other, push them out of the way or even place them right into your path and crush them underneath your wheels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219010/extras/f8ea226336e55c7b2aa05d2f89292600.poster.avif?t=1761670275\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219010/extras/f8ea226336e55c7b2aa05d2f89292600.webm?t=1761670275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219010/extras/f8ea226336e55c7b2aa05d2f89292600.mp4?t=1761670275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Upgrade Your Train, Make Your Deck Powerful</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your train is your deck, each carriage holds unique cards and as your upgrade them, new cards get added to your deck ready to be used. Carriages have synergy cards too, which get activated when both carriages reach max level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219010/extras/82bfb2c4cf88285695c387695fd049f4.poster.avif?t=1761670275\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219010/extras/82bfb2c4cf88285695c387695fd049f4.webm?t=1761670275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219010/extras/82bfb2c4cf88285695c387695fd049f4.mp4?t=1761670275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make Tactical Decisions On the Map</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey is not an easy one. To get to the final destination of your train, you\u2019ll have to make the right choices, sometimes risk making the wrong ones. As your understanding of the game deepens, so will the ideas of what can be done when deciding where to go next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219010/extras/6cafbfd95a01111a59e3bee0b27524ec.poster.avif?t=1761670275\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219010/extras/6cafbfd95a01111a59e3bee0b27524ec.webm?t=1761670275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219010/extras/6cafbfd95a01111a59e3bee0b27524ec.mp4?t=1761670275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stations That Let You Grow</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get your train to a station so that you can heal up or buy a new carriage. Grow stronger as you progress through your run or rebuild your machine after a tough fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219010/extras/f0f39e286be38e7b8993ef0f0d97eb48.poster.avif?t=1761670275\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219010/extras/f0f39e286be38e7b8993ef0f0d97eb48.webm?t=1761670275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219010/extras/f0f39e286be38e7b8993ef0f0d97eb48.mp4?t=1761670275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Made By People That Love Trains</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re a tiny team and each of us has a special place in their heart reserved for trains, having grown up in Europe, trains were always a part of our lives, taking them to get to school, work or just to travel on rainy Mondays. We\u2019re making this game to connect meaningful, deep mechanics with a theme that\u2019s dear to us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219010/extras/2db3cd0615eb621a24917ca13158a075.poster.avif?t=1761670275\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219010/extras/2db3cd0615eb621a24917ca13158a075.webm?t=1761670275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219010/extras/2db3cd0615eb621a24917ca13158a075.mp4?t=1761670275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3219010?t=1761670275","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219010/53d6df09734960bdcca9f4acbb39a83a5013eaf0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761670275","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219010/132c4e9700766a0e9f7d1253a8d6cc36e5cfa7e1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761670275","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219010/132c4e9700766a0e9f7d1253a8d6cc36e5cfa7e1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761670275","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3350900,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fogpiercer is a deckbuilder roguelite in which you build and upgrade your train to build your deck, fight off bandits on a square grid using unique carriage cards. Your final deck will depend on the decisions you make in the run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Moments Of Genius</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Positioning is key and if you play your cards right, you can get the enemies to attack each other, push them out of the way or even place them right into your path and crush them underneath your wheels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219010/extras/f8ea226336e55c7b2aa05d2f89292600.poster.avif?t=1761670275\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219010/extras/f8ea226336e55c7b2aa05d2f89292600.webm?t=1761670275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219010/extras/f8ea226336e55c7b2aa05d2f89292600.mp4?t=1761670275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Upgrade Your Train, Make Your Deck Powerful</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your train is your deck, each carriage holds unique cards and as your upgrade them, new cards get added to your deck ready to be used. Carriages have synergy cards too, which get activated when both carriages reach max level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219010/extras/82bfb2c4cf88285695c387695fd049f4.poster.avif?t=1761670275\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219010/extras/82bfb2c4cf88285695c387695fd049f4.webm?t=1761670275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219010/extras/82bfb2c4cf88285695c387695fd049f4.mp4?t=1761670275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make Tactical Decisions On the Map</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey is not an easy one. To get to the final destination of your train, you\u2019ll have to make the right choices, sometimes risk making the wrong ones. As your understanding of the game deepens, so will the ideas of what can be done when deciding where to go next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219010/extras/6cafbfd95a01111a59e3bee0b27524ec.poster.avif?t=1761670275\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219010/extras/6cafbfd95a01111a59e3bee0b27524ec.webm?t=1761670275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219010/extras/6cafbfd95a01111a59e3bee0b27524ec.mp4?t=1761670275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stations That Let You Grow</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get your train to a station so that you can heal up or buy a new carriage. Grow stronger as you progress through your run or rebuild your machine after a tough fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219010/extras/f0f39e286be38e7b8993ef0f0d97eb48.poster.avif?t=1761670275\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219010/extras/f0f39e286be38e7b8993ef0f0d97eb48.webm?t=1761670275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219010/extras/f0f39e286be38e7b8993ef0f0d97eb48.mp4?t=1761670275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Made By People That Love Trains</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re a tiny team and each of us has a special place in their heart reserved for trains, having grown up in Europe, trains were always a part of our lives, taking them to get to school, work or just to travel on rainy Mondays. We\u2019re making this game to connect meaningful, deep mechanics with a theme that\u2019s dear to us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219010/extras/2db3cd0615eb621a24917ca13158a075.poster.avif?t=1761670275\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219010/extras/2db3cd0615eb621a24917ca13158a075.webm?t=1761670275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219010/extras/2db3cd0615eb621a24917ca13158a075.mp4?t=1761670275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Mad Cookies Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219010/7bcf666f9489cfa04130b0557effffcc1d092350/header.jpg?t=1761670275","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i5-4670 (quad-core)  / AMD\u00ae FX-Series\u2122 FX-8300 (quad-core)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA\u00ae GeForce\u00ae GTX 1060 (6 GB) / AMD\u00ae Radeon\u2122 RX 580 (8 GB)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i5-7600 (quad-core) / AMD\u00ae Ryzen\u2122 5 1300X (quad-core)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA\u00ae GeForce\u00ae GTX 1660 (6 GB) / AMD\u00ae Radeon\u2122 RX 5600 (6 GB)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12 Monterey<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i5-4670 (quad-core)  / AMD\u00ae FX-Series\u2122 FX-8300 (quad-core)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA\u00ae GeForce\u00ae GTX 1060 (6 GB) / AMD\u00ae Radeon\u2122 RX 580 (8 GB)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12 Monterey<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i5-7600 (quad-core) / AMD\u00ae Ryzen\u2122 5 13